{
  "description": [
    {
      "content": "<p>Imperative Workspace API.\nThe easiest way to interact with this API is to use the <code>useWorkspaceRef</code> and <code>useWorkspaceCallbackRef</code> hooks.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>These methods are not restricted by <code>disabled</code>, <code>disableClose</code>, <code>disableDrag</code>, or <code>disableDrop</code>.</p>\n",
      "intent": "primary"
    }
  ],
  "filePath": "lib/workspace/types.ts",
  "methods": [
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Add a tab to a tabset.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>If a tab with the same id already exists, it is selected instead (and its data is not changed).</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        },
        {
          "content": "<ul>\n<li><code>tab</code> Tab to add</li>\n<li><code>options</code> .tabsetId Tabset to add the tab to; defaults to the active tabset</li>\n<li><code>options</code> .index Position within the tabset; defaults to the end</li>\n<li><code>options</code> .select Select the new tab; defaults to true</li>\n</ul>\n"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">addTab</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">    </span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tab</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabNode</span><span class=\"\">&#60;</span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabData</span><span class=\"\">&#62;</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">    </span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">options</span><span class=\"\">?</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">      </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName tok-definition\">index</span><span class=\"\">?</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">number</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-operator\">|</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">undefined</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">      </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName tok-definition\">select</span><span class=\"\">?</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">boolean</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-operator\">|</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">undefined</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">      </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName tok-definition\">tabsetId</span><span class=\"\">?</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-operator\">|</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">undefined</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">    </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">  </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">boolean</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "addTab"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Close a tab.</p>\n"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">closeTab</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tabId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "closeTab"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Close a tabset, along with any tabs it contains (e.g. to remove an empty tabset with the <code>keepWhenEmpty</code> flag).</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>Like the rest of the imperative API, this isn't restricted by tabs' <code>disableClose</code> flags.\nIf the root tabset is closed, the workspace is left with an empty root tabset.</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">closeTabset</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tabsetId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "closeTabset"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Collapse a tabset to just its header.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>This has no effect unless the tabset has the <code>collapsible</code> flag;\nthe only tabset in a workspace, and tabsets whose siblings are all collapsed, can't be collapsed.</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">collapseTabset</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tabsetId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "collapseTabset"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Expand a collapsed tabset to its previous size.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>If the tabset (or one of the tabsets beside it) would be smaller than its minimum size, the workspace resizes them to fit;\n<code>onModelChanged</code> reports the expansion (as <code>&quot;expand&quot;</code>), and then the resize (as <code>&quot;resize&quot;</code>, with <code>isUserInteraction: false</code>),\nbefore the browser paints.</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">expandTabset</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tabsetId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "expandTabset"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Id of the tabset the user most recently interacted with (by pointer or focus).</p>\n"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">getActiveTabsetId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">string</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-operator\">|</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">undefined</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "getActiveTabsetId"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Get the current model.</p>\n"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">getModel</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">WorkspaceModel</span><span class=\"\">&#60;</span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabData</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabsetData</span><span class=\"\">&#62;</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "getModel"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Space (in pixels) in a tabset's tab list that its tabs don't use, e.g. how much a toolbar beside the tabs could grow\nbefore they overflow (and how much space an overflow menu needs to free up, once it's negative).</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>The space is measured along the tab list: its width, or its height if its tabs are placed on the left or right\n(or the tabset is collapsed to a vertical strip).</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>The tab list's <code>--tab-list-free-space</code> custom property has the same value (e.g. &quot;120px&quot;).</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>Within a tabset (e.g. its toolbar), the <code>useTabListFreeSpace</code> hook returns this value (and re-renders when it changes).</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">getTabListFreeSpace</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tabsetId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">number</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-operator\">|</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">undefined</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "getTabListFreeSpace"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Maximize a tabset, so that it covers the rest of the workspace.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>This has no effect on the only tabset in a workspace (the root), which already fills it.\nA maximized tabset is restored if it becomes the only one (e.g. after the other tabsets are closed).</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">maximizeTabset</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tabsetId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "maximizeTabset"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Move a tab to a position within a tabset's tab list, or to a region of a tabset's content area.</p>\n"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">moveTab</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tabId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">target</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabDropTarget</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "moveTab"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Move a tabset beside another tabset (by dropping it onto a region at the edge of that tabset's content area),\nor move its tabs into another tabset (at an <code>index</code> within its tab list, or onto the <code>&quot;center&quot;</code> of its content area).</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>When its tabs are moved, the emptied tabset is removed (unless it has the <code>keepWhenEmpty</code> flag).</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">moveTabset</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tabsetId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">target</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabDropTarget</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "moveTabset"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Restore the maximized tabset (if there is one).</p>\n"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">restoreTabset</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "restoreTabset"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Select a tab within its tabset.</p>\n"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">selectTab</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tabId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "selectTab"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Replace the model.</p>\n"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">setModel</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">    </span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">model</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">WorkspaceModelInput</span><span class=\"\">&#60;</span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabData</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabsetData</span><span class=\"\">&#62;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">  </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-variableName\">WorkspaceModel</span><span class=\"\">&#60;</span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabData</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabsetData</span><span class=\"\">&#62;</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "setModel"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Subscribe to changes to the free space in a tabset's tab list (see <code>getTabListFreeSpace</code>),\ne.g. from a toolbar rendered outside of the Workspace.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>The listener is called synchronously when the tab list is measured (when it or its tabs change size, or tabs are added or removed),\nbefore the browser paints; changes it makes to the DOM (e.g. with <code>flushSync</code>) are shown in the same frame.</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>The listener is called with <code>undefined</code> when the tabset is removed (e.g. closed, or merged into another tabset).</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">subscribeToTabListFreeSpace</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">    </span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tabsetId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">    </span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">listener</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">freeSpace</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">number</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-operator\">|</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">undefined</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">  </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "subscribeToTabListFreeSpace"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Update a tab; fields that are not specified are not changed.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p><code>data</code> is replaced rather than merged.</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<div><span class=\"tok-labelName\">updateTab</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">    </span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">tabId</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">    </span><span class=\"tok-variableName tok-definition\">changes</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">      </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName tok-definition\">data</span><span class=\"\">?</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">TabData</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">      </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName tok-definition\">disableClose</span><span class=\"\">?</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">boolean</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-operator\">|</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">undefined</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">      </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName tok-definition\">disableDrag</span><span class=\"\">?</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">boolean</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-operator\">|</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">undefined</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">      </span><span class=\"tok-propertyName tok-definition\">title</span><span class=\"\">?</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">string</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-operator\">|</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-typeName\">undefined</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">    </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"\"></span></div>\n<div><span class=\"\">  </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">=&#62;</span><span class=\"\"> </span><span class=\"tok-keyword\">void</span><span class=\"tok-punctuation\">;</span></div>",
      "name": "updateTab"
    },
    {
      "description": [
        {
          "content": "<p>Update a tabset; fields that are not specified are not changed.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p><code>data</code> is replaced rather than merged.</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        },
        {
          "content": "<p>Setting <code>minHeight</code>, <code>minWidth</code>, or <code>tabPlacement</code> to <code>undefined</code> removes the tabset's override,\nso the corresponding Workspace prop is used; setting <code>maxHeight</code> or <code>maxWidth</code> to <code>undefined</code> removes the maximum.</p>\n",
          "intent": "primary"
        }
